                <div class="case-study-scenario-card">
                    <div class="scenario-badge">CASE STUDY 1: SCENARIO & CONTEXT</div>
                    <div class="scenario-body-text">Two SOPs have the same title but different instructions and no version number.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-study-discussion-card">
                    <div class="discussion-heading">REGULATORY ASSESSMENT & DISCUSSION</div>
                    <ul class="discussion-list">
                        <li class="discussion-item"><span class="disc-marker">▸</span><span>Users cannot reliably determine which SOP is current.</span></li><li class="discussion-item"><span class="disc-marker">▸</span><span>The documents should be reconciled and controlled.</span></li>
                    </ul>
