                    <div class="scenario-badge">MODULE 06 - CASE STUDY 2: MISSING ESSENTIAL RECORDS</div>
                    <div class="scenario-body-text">During an inspection, the site cannot produce training records for a sub-investigator who performed eligibility assessments.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-study-discussion-card">
                    <div class="discussion-heading">REGULATORY ASSESSMENT & DISCUSSION</div>
                    <ul class="discussion-list">
                        <li class="discussion-item"><span class="disc-marker">▸</span><span>Determine whether the individual was qualified and trained.</span></li><li class="discussion-item"><span class="disc-marker">▸</span><span>Assess the participants and data affected.</span></li><li class="discussion-item"><span class="disc-marker">▸</span><span>Do not create backdated records.</span></li><li class="discussion-item"><span class="disc-marker">▸</span><span>Document the issue and investigation.</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="case-study-takeaway-card"><strong>KEY REGULATORY TAKEAWAY:</strong> Essential records support reconstruction of trial conduct and personnel qualification.</div>
        </div>
        
