    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5315, 3, 16, 'Regulatory Mindset', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 01</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">Regulatory Mindset</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">The Rules should be applied using four questions:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">What product or study is being proposed?</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Is it a new drug, investigational new drug or approved drug?</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Which authority and Ethics Committee approvals are required?</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Which current amendment, guidance or special category applies?</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
