            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">At least 50% of members should not be affiliated with the institution where the Committee is constituted.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The Chairperson should be unaffiliated with the institution, while the Member Secretary is generally affiliated.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
