            <span class="item-content">Site requirements.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Product restrictions.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Protocol-specific commitments.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 102</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5402, 3, 103, 'Clinical-Trial Timelines', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">Clinical-Trial Timelines</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">The Rules generally provide:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">A 90-working-day timeline for a complete clinical-trial application.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">A 30-working-day pathway in specified cases where the drug is discovered, researched and developed in India and proposed for manufacture and marketing in India.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Timelines apply to complete applications and do not eliminate the need for scientific review.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 103</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5403, 3, 104, 'Deemed or Automatic Approval', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">Deemed or Automatic Approval</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">Where the Rules provide deemed approval and no communication is received within the prescribed period:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The applicant must follow the required notification process.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The relevant form must be submitted before initiation.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The application must be complete.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">CDSCO may still review compliance later.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Deemed approval is not immunity from regulatory action.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 104</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5404, 3, 105, 'First-in-Human Trials of Foreign-Developed Drugs', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">First-in-Human Trials of Foreign-Developed Drugs</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">For a new drug discovered or developed outside India:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Phase I data should generally be submitted.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">India may then be considered for repeat Phase I, Phase II or Phase III studies according to the regulatory assessment.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The evidence must support participant safety.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 105</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5405, 3, 106, 'Ethics Committee Approval', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">Ethics Committee Approval</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">Before a site begins:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The protocol must be approved by the registered Ethics Committee.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Relevant documents must be approved.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Approval should be intimated to the CLA within the required timeline.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">A local or appropriately responsible Committee may be used where no local Committee exists under the specified conditions.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 106</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5406, 3, 107, 'CTRI Registration', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">CTRI Registration</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Clinical-trial registration with the Clinical Trials Registry–India is mandatory before enrolment of the first participant.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Global trials involving India also require Indian trial registration details.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 107</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5407, 3, 108, 'Enrolment and Status Reporting', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">Enrolment and Status Reporting</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">Sponsors or investigators should provide:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Enrolment status to the CLA on the required periodic basis.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Six-monthly status updates where applicable.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Information on whether the study is ongoing, completed or terminated.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Reasons for termination where applicable.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
        <div class="footer-right">Page 108</div>
    </div>
    
    </div>
    ', NULL, 15, FALSE, TRUE);
INSERT INTO "slides" ("id", "course_id", "slide_number", "title", "content_html", "image_url", "minimum_dwell_seconds", "has_practice_mcq", "is_active") VALUES (5408, 3, 109, 'Trial-Permission Validity', '
    <div class="presentation-slide-card slide-type-lecture">
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-header">
        <div class="slide-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="slide-breadcrumb">YTAL TECH E-LEARNING  |  NEW DRUGS & CLINICAL TRIALS RULES, 2019  •  MODULE 06</div>
        <h2 class="slide-title-text">Trial-Permission Validity</h2>
        <div class="slide-title-underline"></div>
    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Clinical-trial permission generally remains valid for two years from issue unless extended.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The first subject should be enrolled within the applicable validity period.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
