    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">A BA study measures:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Rate of absorption.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Extent of absorption.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Systemic exposure.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Availability at the site of action when relevant.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Typical pharmacokinetic variables include Cmax, AUC and Tmax.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
    <div class="slide-presentation-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">Ytal Tech E-Learning Platform • <a href="https://www.ytaltech.com" target="_blank">www.ytaltech.com</a></div>
