        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">A BE study determines whether a test formulation and reference formulation have comparable exposure under similar conditions.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
