    </div>
    
        <div class="slide-content-area">
            
        <div class="presentation-lecture-slide">
            <div class="lecture-lead-text">For a new drug or investigational new drug in human participants:</div>
            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">CLA permission is required unless a current amendment provides a specified exemption or prior-intimation pathway.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Application is generally made in Form CT-05.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Required documents and fees must be submitted.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Ethics Committee approval is required before initiation.</span>
        </li>
        </ul>
            
        </div>
        
        </div>
        
