            <ul class="lecture-items-list">
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">For a condition affecting no more than five lakh people in India, an orphan-drug pathway may be relevant.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The sponsor should still provide:</span>
