        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">Enhanced pharmacovigilance.</span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="lecture-list-item icon-arrow">
            <span class="item-symbol">▸</span>
            <span class="item-content">The applicant must clearly define uncertainty and confirmatory plans.</span>
